  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="58">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 58</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="58" corresp="#wit-d">Gif cyninges þegn oððe ænig landrica hit forhæbbe, gilde X healfmarc, healf Criste healf cynge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-d">If a king' thegn or any lord of an estate withholds it, he is to pay 10 half-marks, half to Christ and half to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin" corresp="#wit-d">If a king's thegn or any local lord holds back, he is to pay ten half-marks: half to Christ, half to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn ein Königsthegn oder irgend ein Grundherr es vorenthält, zahle er 10 Halbmark, halb Christo [dem Bischof], halb dem Könige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If a king's thegn or any landlord withholds it, let him pay 10 half-marks, half to Christ [the bishop], half to the king.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares EGu 6.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
